<title>FRANCE: France publishes Aerospatiale sale decree.</title>
<headline>France publishes Aerospatiale sale decree.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The French government on Thursday published a decree in the Official Journal for the sale of a minority stake in Aerospatiale in the framework of a planned merger with Dassault Aviation.</p>
<p>The planned merger, expected before spring, is slated to be followed by a privatisation of the new group.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
